==Tocharian B==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-toc-pro|txb}} {{term/t|ine-toc-pro|*meim}}, a nominal derivative of *''mei-'' ("to measure"). Possibly linked to {{etyl|ine-pro|txb}} *''mod-ye/o-'' or *''mēdye/o-'', derivatives of {{term/t|ine-pro|*med-||to measure, give advice, heal}} (whence Latin {{term|meditor|lang=la}}), or alternatively to *''meh₁-ye/o-'' from {{term/t|ine-pro|*meh₁-||to measure}} (whence Latin {{term|mētior|lang=la}}). Compare Tocharian A {{term|mem|lang=xto}}.

